//! run
//! since: 1.0.0
//! stdout:
//! | " } ' :|
//! | ['{', '\n', ':']
// §1 (Lyric 5 §1, the f-string): a hole holds an expression, its character literals whole — a
// `"` in one opens no string, a `}` closes no hole, a `:` begins no format spec.
println(f"{'"'} {'}'} {'\''} {':'}|")
println(f"{['{', '\n', ':']}")
